{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "autoEstCont 的自动估计过程会使用在 soup 中高表达且作为某些群体标记基因的基因，并在 cluster 层面计算污染比例。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "The idea of this method is that genes that are highly expressed in the soup and are marker genes for some population can be used to estimate the background contamination. Marker genes are identified using the tfidf method (see quickMarkers). The contamination fraction is then calculated at the cluster level for each of these genes and clusters are then aggressively pruned to remove those that give implausible estimates."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "当前你提供 clusters=absent，因此缺少 autoEstCont 在 cluster 层面计算污染比例所需的聚类信息。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:clusters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "聚类信息对 subtraction 方法是被推荐提供的，而不是必需输入或执行阻断条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "As expression data is highly sparse at the single cell level, it is highly recommended that clustering information be provided to allow the subtraction method to share information between cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：该推荐针对 adjustCounts 的 subtraction 方法，不能直接等同于 autoEstCont 的输入要求；autoEstCont 的 cluster 层面计算仍需要聚类信息才能按其描述执行。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "As expression data is highly sparse at the single cell level, it is highly recommended that clustering information be provided to allow the subtraction method to share information between cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你已提供 droplet UMI counts，这符合 SoupX 面向 droplet-based 单细胞测量的背景去除场景。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:count_matrix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SoupX 旨在去除 droplet-based 单细胞测量中的背景 RNA 贡献。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "SoupX aims to remove the contribution of the cell-free mRNA molecules from each cell and recover the true molecular abundance of each gene in each cell."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：autoEstCont 假设通道内包含多种具有不同标记基因的细胞类型；在高度同质的细胞中运行可能得到警告、错误或极高的污染估计，这属于可检测性局限，不代表当前数据一定不适用。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "This function assumes that the channel contains multiple distinct cell types with different marker genes. If you try and run it on a channel with very homogenous cells (e.g. a cell line, flow-sorted cells), you will likely get a warning, an error, and/or an extremely high contamination estimate."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：背景表达谱估计通常使用低于 Nemp UMI 的液滴，但来源没有给出全局整数阈值或必需顺序，不能作为当前数据的硬性输入条件。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "To estimate the background expression profile we consider all droplets with <Nemp UMIs, which we assume unambiguously do not contain cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "你是否有可用的聚类标签（例如来自 Seurat、Scanpy 或其他流程的 cluster 分配）？",
    "missing_field": "cluster_labels",
    "why_needed": "autoEstCont 的描述是在 cluster 层面计算污染比例；没有聚类标签时无法判断自动估计过程能否按其设计执行，也无法确定是否需要先补聚类信息。"
  }
}
